{"id":"86dab741ea658183","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/066_SLD-归结.md","title":"066 SLD-归结","display":"066_SLD-归结","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>修订状态：repair-candidate。原审查评级仅针对备份的原始字节；本稿为授权修复候选。</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-Horn-签名\">1. Horn 签名</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(Fun,Pred,ar_F,ar_P)\">\\(\\Sigma=(Fun,Pred,ar_F,ar_P)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Fun\\cap Pred=\\varnothing\">\\(Fun\\cap Pred=\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_P:Pred\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar_P:Pred\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var,\\quad fun,\\quad atom,\\quad rule,\\quad goal.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var,\\quad fun,\\quad atom,\\quad rule,\\quad goal.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{SLD}\">\\(\\Delta_{SLD}\\)</span> 在第 8 节由已定义的规则族、转移族和答案限制族组成。其中输入对象限于确定子句，目标重写总是选择最左原子，并输出计算答案替换；本系统不含一般子句归结或任意选择函数。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与原子\">2. 项与原子</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(var(x)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Fun\">\\(f\\in Fun\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_F(f)=n\">\\(ar_F(f)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>原子集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"At_\\Sigma\">\\(At_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"atom(P,\\tau)\">\\(atom(P,\\tau)\\)</span> 的集合，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in Pred\">\\(P\\in Pred\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_P(P)=n\">\\(ar_P(P)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-变元、替换与合一\">3. 变元、替换与合一</h1>\n<p>自由变量函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\qquad\nFV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\qquad\nFV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_A(atom(P,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_P(P)}FV_T(\\tau(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_A(atom(P,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_P(P)}FV_T(\\tau(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)=\\{x\\in Var:\\theta(x)\\ne var(x)\\},\n\nSub_\\Sigma=\\{\\theta:Var\\to Tm_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Var\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)=\\{x\\in Var:\\theta(x)\\ne var(x)\\},\n\nSub_\\Sigma=\\{\\theta:Var\\to Tm_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Var\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生恒等替换Id_Sub∈Sub_Σ，Id_Sub(x)=var(x)（x∈Var），supp(Id_Sub)=∅；后文operatorname{id}仅为Id_Sub别名。它的值是变量项。MGU域At²×Sub，η及ρ均量化Sub_Σ。</p>\n<p>替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\)</span> 由下列方程作用：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\theta=\\theta(x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var(x)\\theta=\\theta(x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"fun(f,\\tau)\\theta=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[fun(f,\\tau)\\theta=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"atom(P,\\tau)\\theta=atom(P,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[atom(P,\\tau)\\theta=atom(P,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"MGU(A,B,\\theta)\">\\(MGU(A,B,\\theta)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\theta=B\\theta\">\\(A\\theta=B\\theta\\)</span>，并且任意使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\eta=B\\eta\">\\(A\\eta=B\\eta\\)</span> 的替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 都满足存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in Sub_\\Sigma\">\\(\\rho\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\)</span> 使得对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta(x)=(\\theta(x))\\rho\">\\(\\eta(x)=(\\theta(x))\\rho\\)</span>。本系统无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-确定子句与目标\">4. 确定子句与目标</h1>\n<p>确定子句集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Def_\\Sigma\">\\(Def_\\Sigma\\)</span> 由下列对象组成：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"rule(H,\\beta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[rule(H,\\beta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in At_\\Sigma\">\\(H\\in At_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta:n\\to At_\\Sigma\">\\(\\beta:n\\to At_\\Sigma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 是头原子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 是体原子列。事实是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 的确定子句。</p>\n<p>目标集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Goal_\\Sigma\">\\(Goal_\\Sigma\\)</span> 由所有有限原子列组成：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"goal(\\gamma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[goal(\\gamma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma:m\\to At_\\Sigma\">\\(\\gamma:m\\to At_\\Sigma\\)</span>。空目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"goal(\\varnothing)\">\\(goal(\\varnothing)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>自由变量扩展为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_D(rule(H,\\beta))=FV_A(H)\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}FV_A(\\beta(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_D(rule(H,\\beta))=FV_A(H)\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}FV_A(\\beta(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_G(goal(\\gamma))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;m}FV_A(\\gamma(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_G(goal(\\gamma))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;m}FV_A(\\gamma(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换在确定子句与目标上的作用为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"rule(H,\\beta)\\theta=rule(H\\theta,i\\mapsto\\beta(i)\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[rule(H,\\beta)\\theta=rule(H\\theta,i\\mapsto\\beta(i)\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"goal(\\gamma)\\theta=goal(i\\mapsto\\gamma(i)\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[goal(\\gamma)\\theta=goal(i\\mapsto\\gamma(i)\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换复合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\Theta\\circ\\theta)(x)=(\\Theta(x))\\theta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\Theta\\circ\\theta)(x)=(\\Theta(x))\\theta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-变量分离与选择函数\">5. 变量分离与选择函数</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in Var\\,(\\rho(x)=\\rho(y)\\Rightarrow x=y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in Var\\,(\\rho(x)=\\rho(y)\\Rightarrow x=y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ren_\\Sigma=\\{\\rho:Var\\to Var:\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\\land\\{x:\\rho(x)\\ne x\\}\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Var\\},\n\\qquad \\bar\\rho(x)=var(\\rho(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ren_\\Sigma=\\{\\rho:Var\\to Var:\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\\land\\{x:\\rho(x)\\ne x\\}\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Var\\},\n\\qquad \\bar\\rho(x)=var(\\rho(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>程序子句改名证书定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RenCopy}_{SLD}(G,D,\\rho,D&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\rho\\in Ren_\\Sigma\n\\land D&#39;=D\\bar\\rho\n\\land FV_G(G)\\cap FV_D(D&#39;)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RenCopy}_{SLD}(G,D,\\rho,D&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\rho\\in Ren_\\Sigma\n\\land D&#39;=D\\bar\\rho\n\\land FV_G(G)\\cap FV_D(D&#39;)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>变量分离谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Apart(G,D,D&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho\\in Ren_\\Sigma\\ \n\\operatorname{RenCopy}_{SLD}(G,D,\\rho,D&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Apart(G,D,D&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho\\in Ren_\\Sigma\\ \n\\operatorname{RenCopy}_{SLD}(G,D,\\rho,D&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"sel:Goal_\\Sigma\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[sel:Goal_\\Sigma\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=goal(\\gamma)\">\\(G=goal(\\gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma:m\\to At_\\Sigma\">\\(\\gamma:m\\to At_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"sel(G)=0\">\\(sel(G)=0\\)</span>。空目标没有被选原子。</p>\n<p>定义目标文字替换关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GoalReplace}_{SLD}\n(\\gamma,i,\\beta,\\theta,\\delta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GoalReplace}_{SLD}\n(\\gamma,i,\\beta,\\theta,\\delta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\gamma:m\\to At_\\Sigma,\n\\quad i&lt;m,\n\\quad\\beta:n\\to At_\\Sigma,\n\\quad\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\gamma:m\\to At_\\Sigma,\n\\quad i&lt;m,\n\\quad\\beta:n\\to At_\\Sigma,\n\\quad\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta:(m+n-1)\\to At_\\Sigma,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta:(m+n-1)\\to At_\\Sigma,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta(k)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\gamma(k)\\theta,&amp;k&lt;i,\\\\\n\\beta(k-i)\\theta,&amp;i\\le k&lt;i+n,\\\\\n\\gamma(k-n+1)\\theta,&amp;i+n\\le k&lt;m+n-1.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta(k)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\gamma(k)\\theta,&amp;k&lt;i,\\\\\n\\beta(k-i)\\theta,&amp;i\\le k&lt;i+n,\\\\\n\\gamma(k-n+1)\\theta,&amp;i+n\\le k&lt;m+n-1.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ge m\">\\(i\\ge m\\)</span>，则该关系无证书。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-SLD-步\">6. SLD 步</h1>\n<p>给定程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq Def_\\Sigma\">\\(P\\subseteq Def_\\Sigma\\)</span>，SLD 步关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{SLD}^P\\subseteq Goal_\\Sigma\\times Goal_\\Sigma\\times Sub_\\Sigma\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{SLD}^P\\subseteq Goal_\\Sigma\\times Goal_\\Sigma\\times Sub_\\Sigma\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(goal(\\gamma),goal(\\delta),\\theta)\\in Rule_{SLD}^P\">\\((goal(\\gamma),goal(\\delta),\\theta)\\in Rule_{SLD}^P\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in P\">\\(D\\in P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D&#39;=rule(H,\\beta)\">\\(D&#39;=rule(H,\\beta)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in Ren_\\Sigma\">\\(\\rho\\in Ren_\\Sigma\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RenCopy}_{SLD}(goal(\\gamma),D,\\rho,D&#39;),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RenCopy}_{SLD}(goal(\\gamma),D,\\rho,D&#39;),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"sel(goal(\\gamma))=i,\n\\qquad\nMGU(\\gamma(i),H,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[sel(goal(\\gamma))=i,\n\\qquad\nMGU(\\gamma(i),H,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GoalReplace}_{SLD}(\\gamma,i,\\beta,\\theta,\\delta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GoalReplace}_{SLD}(\\gamma,i,\\beta,\\theta,\\delta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>成立。一步证书定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StepCert}_{SLD}(P,G,G&#39;,\\theta,w)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StepCert}_{SLD}(P,G,G&#39;,\\theta,w)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=(D,\\rho,D&#39;,i,H,\\beta,\\delta)\">\\(w=(D,\\rho,D&#39;,i,H,\\beta,\\delta)\\)</span> 且上述改名、选择、合一和目标替换条件全部成立。</p>\n<p>定义程序参数化规则族</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{SLD}:\n\\mathcal P(Def_\\Sigma)\n\\to\n\\mathcal P(Goal_\\Sigma\\times Goal_\\Sigma\\times Sub_\\Sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{SLD}:\n\\mathcal P(Def_\\Sigma)\n\\to\n\\mathcal P(Goal_\\Sigma\\times Goal_\\Sigma\\times Sub_\\Sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{SLD}(P)=Rule_{SLD}^{P}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{SLD}(P)=Rule_{SLD}^{P}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-SLD-推导与答案\">7. SLD 推导与答案</h1>\n<p>SLD 状态集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"State_{SLD}=Goal_\\Sigma\\times Sub_\\Sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[State_{SLD}=Goal_\\Sigma\\times Sub_\\Sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记替换复合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\\theta\">\\(\\Theta\\theta\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(\\Theta\\theta)=(t\\Theta)\\theta\">\\(t(\\Theta\\theta)=(t\\Theta)\\theta\\)</span>。累积 SLD 转移关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Step_{SLD}^P\\subseteq State_{SLD}\\times State_{SLD}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Step_{SLD}^P\\subseteq State_{SLD}\\times State_{SLD}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((G,\\Theta),(G&#39;,\\Theta\\theta))\\in Step_{SLD}^P\">\\(((G,\\Theta),(G&#39;,\\Theta\\theta))\\in Step_{SLD}^P\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(G,G&#39;,\\theta)\\in Rule_{SLD}^P\">\\((G,G&#39;,\\theta)\\in Rule_{SLD}^P\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义程序参数化转移族</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Step_{SLD}:\n\\mathcal P(Def_\\Sigma)\n\\to\n\\mathcal P(State_{SLD}\\times State_{SLD}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Step_{SLD}:\n\\mathcal P(Def_\\Sigma)\n\\to\n\\mathcal P(State_{SLD}\\times State_{SLD}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Step_{SLD}(P)=Step_{SLD}^{P}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Step_{SLD}(P)=Step_{SLD}^{P}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>末状态谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LastState}_{SLD}(\\Pi,G,\\Theta)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to State_{SLD}\\wedge \\Pi(m-1)=(G,\\Theta)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LastState}_{SLD}(\\Pi,G,\\Theta)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to State_{SLD}\\wedge \\Pi(m-1)=(G,\\Theta)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_{SLD}(P,G_0,\\Pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Der}_{SLD}(P,G_0,\\Pi)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to State_{SLD}\n\\wedge\n\\Pi(0)=(G_0,\\operatorname{id})\n\\wedge\n\\forall i+1&lt;m\\ (\\Pi(i),\\Pi(i+1))\\in Step_{SLD}^{P}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to State_{SLD}\n\\wedge\n\\Pi(0)=(G_0,\\operatorname{id})\n\\wedge\n\\forall i+1&lt;m\\ (\\Pi(i),\\Pi(i+1))\\in Step_{SLD}^{P}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SuccDer}_{SLD}(P,G_0,\\Pi)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Der}_{SLD}(P,G_0,\\Pi)\\land\n\\exists\\Theta\\ \\operatorname{LastState}_{SLD}(\\Pi,goal(\\varnothing),\\Theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SuccDer}_{SLD}(P,G_0,\\Pi)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Der}_{SLD}(P,G_0,\\Pi)\\land\n\\exists\\Theta\\ \\operatorname{LastState}_{SLD}(\\Pi,goal(\\varnothing),\\Theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>答案限制函数具有类型</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ans_X:Sub_\\Sigma\\to Tm_\\Sigma^X,\n\\qquad\nAns_X(\\Theta)(x)=\\Theta(x)\\quad(x\\in X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ans_X:Sub_\\Sigma\\to Tm_\\Sigma^X,\n\\qquad\nAns_X(\\Theta)(x)=\\Theta(x)\\quad(x\\in X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义答案限制函数族</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ans}_{(-)}:\n\\mathcal P(Var)\n\\to\n\\bigcup_{X\\subseteq Var}(Sub_\\Sigma\\to Tm_\\Sigma^X),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ans}_{(-)}:\n\\mathcal P(Var)\n\\to\n\\bigcup_{X\\subseteq Var}(Sub_\\Sigma\\to Tm_\\Sigma^X),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ans}_{(-)}(X)=Ans_X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ans}_{(-)}(X)=Ans_X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若初始目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_0\">\\(G_0\\)</span> 的变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=FV_G(G_0)\">\\(X=FV_G(G_0)\\)</span>，成功推导末状态的累积替换为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Theta=\\theta_0\\theta_1\\cdots\\theta_{k-1},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Theta=\\theta_0\\theta_1\\cdots\\theta_{k-1},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则计算答案是限制函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ans_X(\\Theta)=\\Theta|_X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ans_X(\\Theta)=\\Theta|_X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-SLD-可解性\">8. SLD 可解性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\vdash_{SLD}G\\Downarrow\\sigma\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\Pi\\,\\exists\\Theta\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{SuccDer}_{SLD}(P,G,\\Pi)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{LastState}_{SLD}(\\Pi,goal(\\varnothing),\\Theta)\n\\land\n\\sigma=Ans_{FV_G(G)}(\\Theta)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\vdash_{SLD}G\\Downarrow\\sigma\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\Pi\\,\\exists\\Theta\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{SuccDer}_{SLD}(P,G,\\Pi)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{LastState}_{SLD}(\\Pi,goal(\\varnothing),\\Theta)\n\\land\n\\sigma=Ans_{FV_G(G)}(\\Theta)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义答案集合与成功谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ans_{SLD}(P,G)=\\{\\sigma:P\\vdash_{SLD}G\\Downarrow\\sigma\\},\n\\qquad\nSuccess_{SLD}(P,G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\sigma\\ P\\vdash_{SLD}G\\Downarrow\\sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ans_{SLD}(P,G)=\\{\\sigma:P\\vdash_{SLD}G\\Downarrow\\sigma\\},\n\\qquad\nSuccess_{SLD}(P,G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\sigma\\ P\\vdash_{SLD}G\\Downarrow\\sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异对象定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{SLD}\n=\n\\bigl(\nDef_\\Sigma,\nGoal_\\Sigma,\nsel,\nRule_{SLD},\nStep_{SLD},\n\\operatorname{Ans}_{(-)}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{SLD}\n=\n\\bigl(\nDef_\\Sigma,\nGoal_\\Sigma,\nsel,\nRule_{SLD},\nStep_{SLD},\n\\operatorname{Ans}_{(-)}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{SLD}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma,\nVar,\nTm_\\Sigma,\nAt_\\Sigma,\nDef_\\Sigma,\nGoal_\\Sigma,\nFV_G,\nSub_\\Sigma,Id_{Sub},\nRen_\\Sigma,\nMGU,\nApart,\n\\operatorname{RenCopy}_{SLD},\nsel,\n\\operatorname{GoalReplace}_{SLD},\nRule_{SLD},\n\\operatorname{StepCert}_{SLD},\nState_{SLD},\nStep_{SLD},\n\\operatorname{LastState}_{SLD},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{SLD},\n\\operatorname{SuccDer}_{SLD},\n\\operatorname{Ans}_{(-)},\n\\operatorname{Ans}_{SLD},\n\\vdash_{SLD},\nSuccess_{SLD},\n\\Delta_{SLD}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{SLD}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma,\nVar,\nTm_\\Sigma,\nAt_\\Sigma,\nDef_\\Sigma,\nGoal_\\Sigma,\nFV_G,\nSub_\\Sigma,Id_{Sub},\nRen_\\Sigma,\nMGU,\nApart,\n\\operatorname{RenCopy}_{SLD},\nsel,\n\\operatorname{GoalReplace}_{SLD},\nRule_{SLD},\n\\operatorname{StepCert}_{SLD},\nState_{SLD},\nStep_{SLD},\n\\operatorname{LastState}_{SLD},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{SLD},\n\\operatorname{SuccDer}_{SLD},\n\\operatorname{Ans}_{(-)},\n\\operatorname{Ans}_{SLD},\n\\vdash_{SLD},\nSuccess_{SLD},\n\\Delta_{SLD}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含确定子句、左端选择、SLD 目标重写和计算答案；不含一般子句归结、有序归结或结构解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-Horn-签名","text":"1. Horn 签名","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与原子","text":"2. 项与原子","level":1},{"id":"3.-变元、替换与合一","text":"3. 变元、替换与合一","level":1},{"id":"4.-确定子句与目标","text":"4. 确定子句与目标","level":1},{"id":"5.-变量分离与选择函数","text":"5. 变量分离与选择函数","level":1},{"id":"6.-SLD-步","text":"6. SLD 步","level":1},{"id":"7.-SLD-推导与答案","text":"7. SLD 推导与答案","level":1},{"id":"8.-SLD-可解性","text":"8. SLD 可解性","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(Fun,Pred,ar_F,ar_P)","display":false},{"tex":"Fun\\cap Pred=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"ar_P:Pred\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"var,\\quad fun,\\quad atom,\\quad rule,\\quad goal.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_{SLD}","display":false},{"tex":"Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"var(x)\\in Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in Fun","display":false},{"tex":"ar_F(f)=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"At_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"atom(P,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in Pred","display":false},{"tex":"ar_P(P)=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\qquad\nFV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i<ar_F(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),","display":true},{"tex":"FV_A(atom(P,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i<ar_P(P)}FV_T(\\tau(i)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)=\\{x\\in Var:\\theta(x)\\ne var(x)\\},\n\nSub_\\Sigma=\\{\\theta:Var\\to Tm_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Var\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"var(x)\\theta=\\theta(x),","display":true},{"tex":"fun(f,\\tau)\\theta=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta),","display":true},{"tex":"atom(P,\\tau)\\theta=atom(P,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta).","display":true},{"tex":"MGU(A,B,\\theta)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\theta=B\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"A\\eta=B\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in Sub_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta(x)=(\\theta(x))\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"Def_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"rule(H,\\beta)","display":true},{"tex":"H\\in At_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta:n\\to At_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"Goal_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"goal(\\gamma)","display":true},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma:m\\to At_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"goal(\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"FV_D(rule(H,\\beta))=FV_A(H)\\cup\\bigcup_{i<n}FV_A(\\beta(i)),","display":true},{"tex":"FV_G(goal(\\gamma))=\\bigcup_{i<m}FV_A(\\gamma(i)).","display":true},{"tex":"rule(H,\\beta)\\theta=rule(H\\theta,i\\mapsto\\beta(i)\\theta),","display":true},{"tex":"goal(\\gamma)\\theta=goal(i\\mapsto\\gamma(i)\\theta).","display":true},{"tex":"(\\Theta\\circ\\theta)(x)=(\\Theta(x))\\theta.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in Var\\,(\\rho(x)=\\rho(y)\\Rightarrow x=y).","di